       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "This was my first time making fried rice and this recipe is easy and DELICIOUS! Tastes just like Chinese take out fried rice.\r\n\r\nOnly thing I changed was I used a 12 ounce bag of frozen peas and carrots that I half cooked in the microwave and I used 3 eggs to scramble.\r\n\r\nI recommend not skipping the oyster sauce as well.\r\n\r\nThank you so much for sharing! I am never one to comment on recipes, but this deserves the praise!",
